OL,3,GNEWSACouncil faces legal challenge over
OL,4,Aaviary closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is facing a legal challenge
OL,7,Fto plans to close an aviary that has
OL,8,Fbeen open for nearly 90 years.
OL,10,FSefton Council has said it wants to
OL,11,Fclose the attraction in Southport's
OL,12,FBotanic Gardens because of animal
OL,13,Fwelfare concerns and the costs of
OL,14,Frunning it.
OL,16,FBut the authority has met with
OL,17,Fopposition to the closure, and the Save
OL,18,Four Aviary and Botanic Gardens
OL,19,Fcommunity association has now confirmed
OL,20,Fit has "reluctantly" made the decision
OL,21,Fto take legal action.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
