OL,3,GNEWSACouncil faces legal challenge over
OL,4,Aaviary closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Marion Atkinson
OL,7,Fconfirmed to BBC Radio Merseyside that
OL,8,Fa legal challenge had been lodged, but
OL,9,Fdeclined to comment on it further.
